* 6 (Post Beta 48.1)
* 4 (Post Beta 49.1, Current)
Cost:
* 2 (Post Beta 30.0)
* 6 (Post Beta 48.1, Current)
Abilities:
* Magic: Trigger an ally <= 3G monster's Dust effect. (Post Beta 30.0)
* Magic: Deal Fatigue DMG to the enemy. (Post Beta 48.1, Current)
Rarity: White (Common)

=== Trivia ===
